A cell whose renewal moves a value from one field to another in one arm and leaves it in another, then a write of the field (blind round BN). One run leaves each cell at one place: the callee claims it, and the caller reads the claim where it makes the version. Each write is accepted and runs in place (ownership-v3-kernel.md §13 item 5, amended 2026-11-22). Its live twin is CellRenewalArmsApartLive.
